# TBCGuide - Dwarf & Gnome start: Coldridge Valley and Dun Morogh (1-11)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide A_DwarfGnome_DunMorogh
@name Coldridge Valley & Dun Morogh
@faction Alliance
@races Dwarf,Gnome
@levels 1-11
@zone Dun Morogh
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Dwarf and gnome starting route. Coldridge Valley to about level 5, then Kharanos, the Barleybrew and Amberstill farms and the eastern pass. Ends at about level 11 at the gate to Loch Modan.
@next A_LochModan

accept Dwarven Outfitters | Sten Stoutarm, in front of Anvilmar.
accept The Troll Cave | Grelin Whitebeard's camp south-west of Anvilmar.
accept The Boar Hunter | Talin Keeneye, west of Anvilmar.
accept A Refugee's Quandary | Felix Whindlebolt, north of Anvilmar.
complete Dwarven Outfitters | Wolves around Anvilmar drop Tough Wolf Meat.
turnin Dwarven Outfitters
accept A New Threat
accept 233 Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery
complete A New Threat | Rockjaw Troggs and Burly Rockjaw Troggs in the valley.
complete The Boar Hunter | Small Crag Boars west of Anvilmar.
complete A Refugee's Quandary | Felix's chest, box and bucket are in the camps of the trolls.
turnin A New Threat
turnin A Refugee's Quandary
turnin 233 Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery
accept 234 Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery
turnin The Boar Hunter
train | Classes train inside Anvilmar.
complete The Troll Cave | Frostmane Troll Whelps in the cave west of Grelin.
turnin 234 Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery
turnin The Troll Cave
accept The Stolen Journal
accept Scalding Mornbrew Delivery | Nori Pridedrift at Grelin's camp. Deliver fast; the brew cools.
complete The Stolen Journal | Grik'nir the Cold is at the back of the troll cave.
turnin The Stolen Journal
accept 282 Senir's Observations
turnin Scalding Mornbrew Delivery | Durnan Furcutter inside Anvilmar.
accept Bring Back the Mug
turnin Bring Back the Mug
turnin 282 Senir's Observations | Mountaineer Thalos at the tunnel out of the valley.
accept 420 Senir's Observations
accept Supplies to Tannok [optional] | Hands Springsprocket stands at the tunnel too.
turnin 420 Senir's Observations | Senir Whitebeard in Kharanos.
accept Frostmane Hold
turnin Supplies to Tannok [optional] | Tannok Frosthammer inside the Thunderbrew Distillery.
bind Kharanos
accept Beer Basted Boar Ribs
accept Tools for Steelgrill
accept Ammo for Rumbleshot
accept Stocking Jetsteam | Pilot Bellowfiz, north side of Kharanos.
accept The Grizzled Den | Pilot Stonegear, same house.
accept Operation Recombobulation | Razzle Sprysprocket in the gnome building of Kharanos.
train | Your trainer is in Kharanos.
turnin Tools for Steelgrill | Beldin Steelgrill at Steelgrill's Depot, east of Kharanos.
complete The Grizzled Den | Wendigos in the cave south of Kharanos.
complete Stocking Jetsteam | Boars and bears south of Kharanos.
turnin Stocking Jetsteam
accept Evershine
turnin The Grizzled Den
complete Frostmane Hold | Explore Frostmane Hold, the troll cave west of Kharanos.
accept Bitter Rivals | Marleth Barleybrew, Brewnall Village.
accept The Perfect Stout | Rejold Barleybrew, Brewnall Village.
turnin Evershine
accept A Favor for Evershine
complete A Favor for Evershine | Kill Ice Claw Bears, Elder Crag Boars and Snow Leopards west of Kharanos.
complete Beer Basted Boar Ribs | Crag boar ribs and Rhapsody Malt (buy the malt from Ragnar Thunderbrew's distillery bar).
complete The Perfect Stout | Shimmerweed is carried by the Frostmane trolls west of Brewnall.
turnin A Favor for Evershine
accept Return to Bellowfiz
turnin The Perfect Stout
accept Shimmer Stout
turnin Frostmane Hold
accept The Reports
turnin Bitter Rivals | The barrel stands inside the Thunderbrew Distillery.
accept Return to Marleth
turnin Return to Bellowfiz
turnin Beer Basted Boar Ribs
complete Operation Recombobulation | Leper Gnomes at the Gnomeregan entrance and the tunnel west of Kharanos.
turnin Operation Recombobulation
turnin Return to Marleth
turnin Ammo for Rumbleshot | Hegnar Rumbleshot's camp at the lake east of Kharanos.
accept Protecting the Herd | Rudra Amberstill at the Amberstill Ranch.
accept Those Blasted Troggs! | Foreman Stonebrow, Gol'Bolar Quarry.
accept The Public Servant
complete Those Blasted Troggs! | Troggs in the quarry.
complete The Public Servant | Troggs inside the quarry mine.
turnin Those Blasted Troggs!
turnin The Public Servant
complete Protecting the Herd | Vagash is a wandering yeti on the hill above the ranch.
turnin Protecting the Herd
accept The Lost Pilot | Pilot Hammerfoot, near the North Gate Pass.
turnin The Lost Pilot
accept A Pilot's Revenge
complete A Pilot's Revenge | Mangeclaw prowls nearby.
turnin A Pilot's Revenge
turnin Shimmer Stout | Mountaineer Barleybrew guards the tunnel to Loch Modan.
accept Stout to Kadrell
turnin The Reports [optional] | Senator Barin Redstone in Ironforge - do it if you go to Ironforge to train.
level 11
note Go through the South Gate tunnel into Loch Modan.
